  m_text: 'Welcome to <b>CyberQuest</b>, a story-driven video game designed to teach
    the fundamentals of cybersecurity through an engaging and immersive experience.


    Step
    into the role of a cybersecurity expert and take on challenges and ethical dilemmas.
    Whether you are new to the field or looking to sharpen your skills, CyberQuest
    will guide you through engaging quests and help you think critically.'
